 detik. Harap bersabar','First image in content'=>'Gambar pertama dalam konten','Default image'=>'Gambar default','Local'=>'Lokal','Style'=>'Gaya','Applied only when generating with an AI bank. Photo banks (Bing, Pexels…) ignore this.'=>'Hanya berlaku dengan bank AI. Bank foto (Bing, Pexels…) mengabaikannya.','Photorealistic'=>'Fotorealistis','Oil painting'=>'Lukisan minyak','Watercolor'=>'Cat air','Cinematic'=>'Sinematik','3D render'=>'Render 3D','Minimal'=>'Minimal','Anime'=>'Anime','Custom style'=>'Gaya kustom','Extra instructions appended to the AI prompt.'=>'Instruksi tambahan di akhir prompt AI.','e.g. editorial product shot, soft daylight'=>'mis. foto produk editorial, cahaya siang lembut','No text on the image'=>'Tanpa teks pada gambar','Ask the AI not to render captions, titles or watermarks.'=>'Minta AI agar tidak menulis keterangan, judul, atau watermark.','No API key. During generation, the first image already present in the post content is used if previous banks in the chain failed.'=>'Tanpa kunci API. Jika bank sebelumnya gagal, gambar pertama di pos digunakan.','Assigned when every other bank in the chain fails. Place this bank last.'=>'Digunakan saat semua bank lain gagal. Letakkan di akhir rantai.','Select image'=>'Pilih gambar','Remove'=>'Hapus','Brand overlay'=>'Bilah judul / merek','Disabled'=>'Nonaktif','Title bar'=>'Bilah judul','Title and logo'=>'Judul dan logo','Draws a bar with the post title on the generated image. Disabled by default.'=>'Menggambar bilah berisi judul pos. Nonaktif secara default.','Overlay look'=>'Tampilan bilah','Bar color'=>'Warna bilah','Bar opacity'=>'Opasitas bilah','Text color'=>'Warna teks','Also show the first category'=>'Tampilkan juga kategori pertama','Overlay logo'=>'Logo bilah','Select logo'=>'Pilih logo','This bank does not support keyword preview. During generation it uses the first image already in the post.'=>'Bank ini tidak mendukung pratinjau kata kunci. Saat generate, gambar pertama di pos digunakan.','